<body>
    <h1>Step by Step</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=
=3D"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1qR-XArODMjNtecdPj3_VG5QGGwlzthQ=
kWkmIRZmp6vo/edit?gid=3D0#gid=3D0" rel=3D"nofollow">https://docs.google.com=
/spreadsheets/d/1qR-XArODMjNtecdPj3_VG5QGGwlzthQkWkmIRZmp6vo/edit?gid=3D0#g=
id=3D0</a></p>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"StepbyStep-WhensalesrepisreadyforQuotetoInvoice:">When sales rep =
is ready for Quote to Invoice:</h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>They fill out the sales order form</p></li>
<li>
<p>CSL Automation</p></li>
<li>
<p>Sent to Customer Operations <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222=
,200);">Que/task</span></p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<p>Convert to order:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Creates Order Record</p></li>
<li>
<p>Copies detail from quote</p></li>
<li>
<p>Order Line items created</p></li>
</ul>
<p>Opportunity Stage =3D ?</p>
<p>Assets/Contracts created =3D ?</p>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<h1 id=3D"StepbyStep-CyberNew&amp;Renew">Cyber New &amp; Renew</h1>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Opportunity Stage Moves to - =E2=80=9CReady to Review for Order=E2=80=9D=
</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Callout</strong> - CSL Automation</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Run the CSL API</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>CSL Returns =3D On Hold</p></li>
<li>
<p>Update Account Field =E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening List=E2=80=9D =3D O=
n Hold</p></li>
<li>
<p>Update Opportunity Field =E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=9D=
 =3D On Hold</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Auto Task: </strong>Product Specialist: Routes based on product =
family</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Manual: </strong>Customer Operations review</p></li>
<li>
<p>Once complete Customer Operations will manually update Update Opportunit=
y Field =E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=9D =3D Approved</p></l=
i>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>CSL Returns =3D Approved</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Update Account Field =E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening List=E2=80=9D =3D A=
pproved</p></li>
<li>
<p>Update Opportunity Field =E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=9D=
 =3D Approved</p></li>
<li>
<p>Move to next stage of Fulfillment process</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Manual</strong>: Sales Rep Fills out Form</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Questions needed:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>=E2=80=A6=E2=80=A6(See MS Form)</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Auto Task: </strong>Product Specialist: Routes based on product =
family</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Cyber products =E2=86=92 Cyber fulfillment team</p></li>
<li>
<p>Tech products =E2=86=92 Tech fulfillment team</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>RPA+ =E2=86=92 Tech fulfillment team</p></li>
<li>
<p>MFT =E2=86=92 Tech fulfillment team</p></li>
<li>
<p>Power =E2=86=92 Tech fulfillment team</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Manual Task</strong> - Review Opportunity</p></li>
<li>
<p>=E2=80=A6=E2=80=A6Mark opp as Closed won=E2=80=A6</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Auto Task:</strong> Create Order</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Manual Task</strong>: Activate Order</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Staged Assetize:</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Callout</strong>: Invoice detail sent to Workday (<strong>Point =
of No Return</strong>)</p></li>
<li>
<p><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,200);">? Do assets get crea=
ted but we can still wait until after payment? (Assets/Contracts/Next Oppor=
tunity)</span></p></li>
<li>
<p><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,200);">? Do customers get a=
ccess to support portal at what point? </span></p></li>
<li>
<p><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,200);">? How difficult is i=
t to re-do after Created Assets to make adjust? </span></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Manual Task: </strong>Coordinate customer access (owner varies)<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Manual Task</strong>: Send notification to customer about access=
 (owner varies)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Auto Task:</strong> Create Renewal Opportunity/Assets/Contract e=
tc</p></li>
<li>
<p><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,200);">If we need the Futur=
e Opp to auto create quote 90 days before expiration date do we need to doc=
ument this here in Order Orchestration</span></p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,200);">This may might be an=
other fulfillment process for Automated Renewals?</span></p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<p></p>
